{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300a\u6625\u65e5\u51ac\u9752\u300bis a 3D pixel-style side-scrolling adventure puzzle game where you must fully utilize the special abilities of various objects in the environment to help the elves in each level complete their challenges or solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features physics-based mechanics, combinations of objects with diverse functions, a wealth of interactive scene elements, numerous charming NPC characters, and the ability to customize your character's appearance at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><u>Note: This is a trial version. Compared to the full version, this version only includes the first three chapters of playable content and some collectibles. It is only available in Chinese, with the English version to be expected in the full release.</u></i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3898770?t=1753756787","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3898770?t=1753756787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898770/e330497ec1b1061b7d23ea057228a8f169b0ab80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753756787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898770/e330497ec1b1061b7d23ea057228a8f169b0ab80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753756787","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300a\u6625\u65e5\u51ac\u9752\u300bis a 3D pixel-style side-scrolling adventure puzzle game where you must fully utilize the special abilities of various objects in the environment to help the elves in each level complete their challenges or solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features physics-based mechanics, combinations of objects with diverse functions, a wealth of interactive scene elements, numerous charming NPC characters, and the ability to customize your character's appearance at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><u>Note: This is a trial version. Compared to the full version, this version only includes the first three chapters of playable content and some collectibles. It is only available in Chinese, with the English version to be expected in the full release.</u></i></strong></p>","developers":["CoreFlashGames"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3892310","name":"GwenAndTheWinterGreen"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898770/c6e8d0d046944987bbd7e7b281b5a3d85f500f55/header.jpg?t=1753756787","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257172417,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172417/movie480.mp4?t=1753756610","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172417/movie_max.mp4?t=1753756610"},"name":"\u6625\u65e5\u51ac\u9752EP01","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257172417/1a50fda377acb93224d58847ba3bc86215a7773a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753756610","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172417/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753756610","max":"http://video.akamai.stea